The recent spate of duplicate messages on thist list was due to a
seriously broken mail system at a subscribing siteD: ziff.com.  This
system was taking messages from alpha-osf-managers, changing the From
header to something like "From: alpha-osf-managers-relay@ornl.gov
(Real Sender)", and replacing the Message-ID header with a new one.

