lead to defunct processes tying up ports. The patch is UVO102126, the file is 
called C941227-5369.tar.Z,  (/usr/sys/BINARY/kern_exit.o), and requires a 
kernel rebuild. This does not however solve my problem, since I already 
installed this one along with others.

